{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"新能源制造业","country":"越南","country_iso":"VNM","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:28:48.556939","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"VNM-MF-0003","ldc":"No","location":"广宁省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"越南海河光伏电池技术一体化项目","project_name_en":"Jinko Solar Vietnam Hai Ha PV Cell Technology Integration Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中国建筑东南亚","content":"2月7日，中国建筑（东南亚）有限公司成功中标\n晶科能源越南海河光伏电池技术一体化\n项目\n。\n项目位于越南广宁省，广河镇，海河工业区，是东南亚公司在越南地区的\n首个光伏产业相关项目\n，\n也是公司目前承接的\n首个建筑面积超20万平方米\n的厂房类项目，对打开相关领域市场具有\n里程碑\n式的意义。\n该项目采用施工总承包模式，包含电池车间、组件车间、组件仓库、公用建筑等。主要建设内容为建筑主体结构、建筑装修、红线内道路及绿化等。\n据悉，该项目业主为晶科能源股份有限公司（简称“晶科能源”）是一家全球知名、极具创新力的太阳能科技企业。秉承“改变能源结构，承担未来责任”的使命，公司战略性布局光伏产业链核心环节，聚焦光伏产品一体化研发制造和清洁能源整体解决方案提供，销量领跑全球主流光伏市场。","content_sha256":"935bcaeb1bf64fe7a16b7f1ffc4679e1557ad3ace0db95126204ed03032e6d59","id":9612,"publish_date":"2024-02-08 00:02:02","title":"中国建筑（东南亚）有限公司中标晶科能源越南海河光伏电池技术一体化项目","title_sha256":"65d5a7bf0577aeca914e12743d375ec054a8569987321c071808bd2fdf56e648","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/60015.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"VNM-MF-0003","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:28:48.557106","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"VNM-MF-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.bhi.com.cn/News/ShowDetails.aspx?columns=6&label=9748&id=81627499\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科能源股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"JinkoSolar","project_stage":"中标","projec